{"sourceId":"thinksr","title":"ThinkSR: compact thought, dense output","lang":"en","scenes":[{"id":"s01-flow","intent":"The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, while the dense carrier continues through the end-to-end flow.","claim":"ThinkSR runs encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, and decoder; parameters are shared across ticks.","narration":"The image first becomes a dense carrier, so spatial detail is available before the compact thought process starts. Windowing partitions that carrier without turning the whole model into a global recurrent loop. The DQ-CTM stage repeats on itself, so the recurrence is local to the thought process. The same DQ-CTM parameters are reused across ticks rather than growing with the tick count. The close view isolates the repeated thought stage because that is where the recurrence lives.","evidence":[{"kind":"figure","id":"fig-arch"},{"kind":"section","id":"sec2"}],"weight":0.9,"seconds":10,"objects":[{"id":"headline","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.5,"y":0.12},"size":{"w":0.86,"h":0.08},"text":"The loop returns to the thought stage, not the whole flow.","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":70,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"encode","kind":"rect","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.18,"y":0.50},"size":{"w":0.18,"h":0.16},"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":"a","fill":"surface","opacity":0},{"id":"encode-label","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.18,"y":0.50},"size":{"w":0.15,"h":0.08},"text":"Encode","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":46,"tone":"a","fill":null,"opacity":0},{"id":"window","kind":"rect","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.38,"y":0.50},"size":{"w":0.18,"h":0.16},"text":null,"tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":null,"tone":"b","fill":"surface","opacity":0},{"id":"window-label","kind":"text","parent":null,"at":{"x":0.38,"y":0.50},"size":{"w":0.15,"h":0.08},"text":"Window","tex":null,"figureId":null,"points":null,"fontPx":46,"ton